      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the pre‑pickup condition report protect my bike during transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Before loading, a certified technician documents the bike’s visual and mechanical state with photos and a checklist. This report is shared with the customer and serves as a baseline for any claim. Should any damage occur, the report provides clear evidence, ensuring swift resolution under our IRDAI‑approved insurance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is bike shifting by train a viable alternative for Reoti Ballia shipments?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Train‑based bike shifting (IRCTC bike transport) can be cost‑effective for long distances, but it lacks the hands‑on handling, real‑time GPS updates, and dedicated protective packaging that Shree Ashirwad offers. For high‑value or delicate bikes, the hydraulic trailer service guarantees zero‑scratch delivery and instant claim support.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation do I need to provide for bike transportation in Reoti Ballia?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, and a signed consignment note. If you require reimbursement from a corporate or government entity, our GST‑compliant invoice and e‑Way bill are accepted. All paperwork is prepared by our team to streamline the process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the GPS location update system work during the 850 km transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each trailer is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that transmits location data every 15 minutes to a secure portal. Customers receive real‑time alerts via SMS or email, allowing them to monitor the bike’s progress along the National Highway arterial corridors until doorstep delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with Bike Transportation In Reoti Ballia?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment includes 100% declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI, covering accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities. The policy is automatically activated at pickup and remains valid until the bike is handed over at the destination, ensuring complete financial protection without extra paperwork.</p>
