nd instant claim support."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What documentation do I need to provide for bike transportation in Reoti Ballia?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You’ll need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, and a signed consignment note. If you require reimbursement from a corporate or government entity, our GST‑compliant invoice and e‑Way bill are accepted. All paperwork is prepared by our team to streamline the process."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the GPS location update system work during the 850 km transit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Each trailer is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that transmits location data every 15 minutes to a secure portal. Customers receive real‑time alerts via SMS or email, allowing them to monitor the bike’s progress along the National Highway arterial corridors until doorstep delivery."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What insurance coverage is included with Bike Transportation In Reoti Ballia?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Every shipment includes 100% declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI, covering accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities. The policy is automatically activated at pickup and remains valid until the bike is handed over at the destination, ensuring complete financial protection without extra paperwork."}}]}
